<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσήπομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεσάπην [ᾰ</span>] <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Aph.</u>
			6.58
		</span></i>: fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σᾰπήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			: with pf.
			
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσέσηπα</span> (v.
				infr.):—<i>lose by rotting</i> or <i>mortification,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοὺς ψύχους τῶν ποδῶν ἀποσεσηπότες</span>
			<i>having lost</i> the toes by frost-bite, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.5.12
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				5.8.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
			</span></i></div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of water, <i>throw off
			impurities</i> by boiling, joined with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφέψεσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aë.r.</i><i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> causal in 
				Act.
			, <i>cause to putrefy, remove by putrefaction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Haem.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ράλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Gland.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐκ τοῦ σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.820
				</span></i>
			, cf. Aë.<i><span class="en">
				1.18
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
